WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.072
"Happy Halloween!" Aunt Judy said.

2
00:00:09.073 --> 00:00:13.335
"I have the best costume!" Harry said.

3
00:00:13.336 --> 00:00:16.592
"Cowboys get the most treats!"

4
00:00:16.593 --> 00:00:23.903
Emmy frowned. "Vampires get a lot of treats too."

5
00:00:23.904 --> 00:00:28.716
"So do ninjas," Oliver said.

6
00:00:28.717 --> 00:00:33.493
"You all have good costumes," Aunt Judy said.

7
00:00:33.494 --> 00:00:36.251
"I hope everyone gets lots of treats.

8
00:00:36.252 --> 00:00:40.506
And no tricks."

9
00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:48.733
Harry laughed. "No one will trick me!"

10
00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:53.457
"Hmm," Aunt Judy said.

11
00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:58.397
The kids went trick-or-treating.

12
00:00:58.398 --> 00:01:07.177
They got lots of treats.

13
00:01:07.178 --> 00:01:11.412
"We can share," Emmy said.

14
00:01:11.413 --> 00:01:18.041
"No way," Harry said. "I'm not sharing!"

15
00:01:18.042 --> 00:01:22.612
The kids went home.

16
00:01:22.613 --> 00:01:26.970
Suddenly a witch jumped out from behind a tree.

17
00:01:26.971 --> 00:01:29.374
"Boo!" the witch yelled.

18
00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:33.873
The kids screamed.

19
00:01:33.874 --> 00:01:37.736
They dropped their treat bags and ran.

20
00:01:37.737 --> 00:01:51.508
The witch scooped up the bags.

21
00:01:51.509 --> 00:01:54.959
"Hey!" Oliver cried.

22
00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:59.688
"That's Aunt Judy!"

23
00:01:59.689 --> 00:02:03.567
Aunt Judy came over and took off her mask.

24
00:02:03.568 --> 00:02:09.740
She grinned. "It was a Halloween trick!

25
00:02:09.741 --> 00:02:14.500
Here are your treat bags."

26
00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:18.098
"Look at how many treats I got!" Harry said.

27
00:02:18.099 --> 00:02:22.107
He dumped out his bag.

28
00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:28.877
It was full of pinecones!

29
00:02:28.878 --> 00:02:34.792
"Hey! Where are my treats?" Harry cried.

30
00:02:34.793 --> 00:02:39.378
"Tricked you again!" Aunt Judy said.

31
00:02:39.379 --> 00:02:42.750
Aunt Judy gave Harry another bag.

32
00:02:42.751 --> 00:02:46.769
"I switched the bags.

33
00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:56.177
Here are your treats."

34
00:02:56.178 --> 00:03:01.173
"Let's share," Harry said.

35
00:03:01.174 --> 00:03:11.407
"Treats are better than tricks!"

